    {
      "text": "The human reporter said they wanted to try that connector-numbering step in the next repair.",
      "support": [7],
      "basis": "memory",
      "facet": "meaning"
    },
    {
      "text": "The correction mattered because it redirected the credit for the connector-numbering checklist from the suspected Mara attribution to the River account.",
      "support": [7],
      "basis": "memory",
      "facet": "meaning"
    },
    {
      "text": "According to the corrected attribution, the connector-numbering checklist belongs to the River account, not to Mara Ibarra.",
      "support": [7],
      "basis": "memory",
      "facet": "outcome"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial human report, received on 2026-07-01, contained a tentative suspicion that c1200 might be Mara, but the later correction did not make that certain.",
      "support": [7],
      "basis": "memory",
      "facet": "outcome"
    },
    {
      "text": "The supplied memories do not record whether the connector-numbering procedure was actually tried in the next repair.",
